      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JET SPRINT (6) struggled to get involved last start at this track, but prior to that won by half a length at this track (20.28) beating Hot Honey in a Bottom Up - Grade 7 on August 5. Has ability and is a key runner. WAVE IN SEA (5) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, hitting the frame latest when 3rd at this track over 350m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Will give a great sight again. BLACK CHAKRA (7) started at long odds last time but ran well above expectations, breaking through for a maiden win by 0.9 lengths at this track over 300m (17.22). Will break from a wide draw. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. ZINZAN HOLLY (1) has been freshened and can sneak into the frame on her best form.",
